{"obsah":"<p>A traditional event for Martin Šimůnek and something new for Vlasta as a guest rider. The big North Bohemian cycling race impressed with the quality of its organisation, its side programme and above all more than 900 registered riders. The pleasant surroundings of the Rumburk centre also attracted countless spectators, who together with the riders created a nice backdrop for our exhibition.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>We coped with the smaller space and stretched the exhibition out a bit. We also invited a young gun from the crowd, who had ridden the race as a Junior but caught the Trial bug at the workshop and managed a few basic moves. Thanks for the invitation to this 39th edition – and here's to the 40th.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2712.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2712.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238172\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2713.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2713.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238173\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2714.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2714.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238174\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2716.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2716.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238169\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2717.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2717.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238170\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2718.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2718.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238178\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2719.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2719.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238175\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2720.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2720.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-23